  "entries": [
    {
      "text": "SPOINK bounces around on its tail. The shock of its bouncing makes its heart pump. As a result, this POKéMON cannot afford to stop bouncing - if it stops, its heart will stop.",
      "version": "ruby"
    },
    {
      "text": "SPOINK keeps a pearl on top of its head. The pearl functions to amplify this POKéMON’s psychokinetic powers. It is therefore on a constant search for a bigger pearl.",
      "version": "sapphire"
    },
    {
      "text": "A POKéMON that manipulates psychic power at will. It doesn’t stop bouncing even when it is asleep. It loves eating mushrooms that grow underground.",
      "version": "emerald"
    },
    {
      "text": "It apparently dies if it stops bouncing about. It carries a pearl from CLAMPERL on its head.",
      "version": "firered"
    },
